  "Active, ending stressed: group B. Ending contains -ά-: B1; otherwise B2.",
  "Passive with -o- in the ending (-ομαι): passive group 1. With -ά- (-άμαι): passive group 2.",
  "Note: υ in -ευω is [v], a consonant, so δουλεύω is A1. Stress decides τελειώνω (A1) vs τηλεφωνώ (B2)."
